{
  "id": "6a7fa1162fc672a10e74bad1",
  "title": "ゲーム内アイテムのように解説する栄養素",
  "created": 1786749207,
  "updated": 1786749757,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a7fa1162fc672a10e74bad1",
      "text": "ゲーム内アイテムのように解説する栄養素",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749207,
      "updated": 1786749207
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7fa116000000000026ecb0",
      "text": "from [2026/08/15]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749207,
      "updated": 1786749207
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7fa11d000000000026ecb9",
      "text": "[Summer498.icon]：ゲーム内アイテムのように解説する栄養素",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749222,
      "updated": 1786749227
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7fa12d000000000026ecbb",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749229,
      "updated": 1786749229
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7fa116000000000026ecb2",
      "text": "炭水化物",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749207,
      "updated": 1786749231
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7fa12e000000000026ecbc",
      "text": "\tエネルギー源。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749231,
      "updated": 1786749264
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7fa150000000000026ecc4",
      "text": "\tすぐに効果が出る。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749264,
      "updated": 1786749264
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7fa132000000000026ecbd",
      "text": "\t安定的な気分を作り出す。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749234,
      "updated": 1786749236
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7fa134000000000026ecbe",
      "text": "\t空腹の解消に貢献しない。\t例：空腹時に白米を腹一杯食べても空腹は収まらない。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749236,
      "updated": 1786749480
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7fa135000000000026ecbf",
      "text": "\t疲労時に摂取すると眠気が出る。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749237,
      "updated": 1786749237
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7fa13b000000000026ecc0",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749243,
      "updated": 1786749243
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7fa116000000000026ecb3",
      "text": "脂質：",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749207,
      "updated": 1786749245
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7fa13d000000000026ecc1",
      "text": "\tエネルギー源。ゆっくり効果が出る。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749245,
      "updated": 1786749416
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7fa1df000000000026ecca",
      "text": "\t空腹を解消する。ゆっくり効果が出る。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749408,
      "updated": 1786749435
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7fa206000000000026eccb",
      "text": "\t安定的な気分を作り出す。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749446,
      "updated": 1786749446
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7fa160000000000026ecc6",
      "text": "\t摂取しすぎると胃もたれを起こす。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749281,
      "updated": 1786749446
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7fa140000000000026ecc2",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749248,
      "updated": 1786749248
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7fa116000000000026ecb4",
      "text": "タンパク質：",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749207,
      "updated": 1786749372
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7fa1bb000000000026ecc7",
      "text": "\t空腹を解消する。すぐに効果が出る。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749372,
      "updated": 1786749422
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7fa1bf000000000026ecc8",
      "text": "\tタンパク質のみでは速やかに空腹になる。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749375,
      "updated": 1786749379
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7fa1c3000000000026ecc9",
      "text": "\t身体の材料になる。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749379,
      "updated": 1786749379
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7fa140000000000026ecc3",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749248,
      "updated": 1786749248
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7fa271000000000026eccd",
      "text": "ミネラル：",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749553,
      "updated": 1786749562
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7fa27a000000000026eccf",
      "text": "\t神経伝達の異常を解消する。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749562,
      "updated": 1786749624
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7fa272000000000026ecce",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749554,
      "updated": 1786749554
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7fa116000000000026ecb5",
      "text": "食物繊維：",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749207,
      "updated": 1786749248
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7fa116000000000026ecb6",
      "text": "\t腸内環境を洗浄する。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749207,
      "updated": 1786749207
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7fa116000000000026ecb7",
      "text": "\t快便の材料。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749207,
      "updated": 1786749207
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7fa116000000000026ecb8",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749207,
      "updated": 1786749207
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7fa2c1000000000026ecd1",
      "text": "ビタミン：",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749633,
      "updated": 1786749643
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7fa2ca000000000026ecd3",
      "text": "\t身体を構築する。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749643,
      "updated": 1786749733
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7fa325000000000026ecd5",
      "text": "\t\tタンパク質が身体を構築する材料なら、ビタミンは大工。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749733,
      "updated": 1786749757
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7fa2ca000000000026ecd2",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786749642,
      "updated": 1786749642
    }
  ]
}